<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's White-Martins 1996 net higher.</title>
<headline>Brazil's White-Martins 1996 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil oxygen producer White-Martins issued the following statement on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>		  1996		   1995</p>
<p>    Shr profit   0.06 reais	   0.04 reais</p>
<p>    Net profit   116.7 million	    55.3 million</p>
<p>    Net revs     909.8 million	    629.6 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All data above in Brazilian reais. Share profit figures provided in lots of 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
</text>
